cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this code, please cite them as below."
title: "Where do Idaté and Lakalei belong? A pre-registered lexical-phylogenetic test of two classifications of Timor's Austronesian languages"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Crowley
    given-names: Dennis
    affiliation: Phaistos Labs
version: "3.0"
date-released: 2026-10-13
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/DenC-dev/liabut"
keywords:
  - Timor
  - Austronesian
  - subgrouping
  - computational phylogenetics
  - language contact
  - pre-registration
abstract: >-
  Data, code, protocol and results for a pre-registered computational test of two disputed placements in the
  Austronesian languages of Timor (Lakalei-Idate and Welaun), with a second round of analyses declared after a
  mock referee report. Derived datasets include Grimes and Edwards's (2026) comparative tables as data, expert and
  automatic reflex atlases, sound-change matrices and a specialist review packet.
